{"v":3,"catch":"在最令人愉快的記憶遊戲中提升你的專注力和集中力！","desc":"您是否正在尋找一款既輕鬆迷人，又能同時提升記憶力與專注力的遊戲？\n沉浸於《Cozy Memory》中吧，每一張卡片都將挑戰並愉悅您的心靈。這裡，記憶訓練就是純粹的享受！\n\n經常玩記憶遊戲能讓頭腦保持敏銳，心情更加愉快。而且，《Cozy Memory》迷人的手繪卡片，絕對是一場視覺盛宴。\n\n超越傳統記憶拼圖的規則，《Cozy Memory》還提供難度選擇，無論您是記憶高手還是初學者，都能獲得滿意的體驗。\n\n主要特色：\n- 多樣化的難度等級\n- 溫馨插畫與可愛動物\n- 色彩繽紛又有趣的卡片背面\n- 放鬆身心的音樂","publisher":"REDDEER.GAMES","release":"2025-10-16","genres":["益智","桌上遊戲","實用","學習"],"players":"單機 1 人","langs":["日文","葡萄牙文","英文","西班牙文","法文","德文","義大利文","韓文","中文 (繁體)"],"pmax":1,"poff":1,"rating":"普遍級","size":"Switch 2 0.2GB / Switch 0.2GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/8ea0330d9fdca61af858ccb0bb21760858e4570e53acc0f31f3584aa0bc9bd18.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/896ecc976ded91bcc5e9fe278ecbc82d6c1bc2168300d449763b930f8b7c7004.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/006a3f0ee95b3d66a230f8efce55139821f8eac5f08e86faa0a8810592d9125c.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/6af9503af370234d728b0d357d0ef9ae4abc9be69c38406c70463b6799a619e3.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/9ab75d5197a3f8cddd11b47bd356e947cd79c872a83c018b5d52e845691f507a.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/f75dd707295aaa6a259f707318ed65d3b3ff7851b593823949461a63ef2e7136.jpg"],"titleId":"01007c5025ad0000","dlc":[{"id":"70050000065433","name":"背面圖案包","img":"9cb6ada0d227f5b3a5538c432f8835882ff5165ad43c5d97e019191ff51bcf05","date":"2025-11-13","mem":false},{"id":"70050000065434","name":"卡牌包1","img":"413e22c4c38e1730117a8089f9e1ac957d7857011b2dc45cd2b1950307786213","date":"2026-01-12","mem":false},{"id":"70050000065436","name":"卡牌包2","img":"dd9d42d1ea51a71d312efc3c904cb671f88a913df2d281bb3df4f2f1a98f4215","date":"2026-03-18","mem":false},{"id":"70050000065437","name":"卡牌包3","img":"2a19533d8c975231eb91b06a7da43029bad9ebe65ac58a1e41e467438eb06849","date":"2026-05-14","mem":false},{"id":"70050000065438","name":"卡牌包4","img":"2acdf5f97e5333e752ccc68650f180e6ce4aeeaadf178569dc854efa19b3cb57","date":"2026-07-11","mem":fals